### 1. Listar tópicos
GET {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Detalle de un tópico (particiones, réplicas, configuración)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/uso-equipamiento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Crear tópico con configuración -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "prueba-admin",
  "partitions": 2,
  "replicationFactor": 3,
  "configs": { "retention.ms": "86400000", "cleanup.policy": "delete" }
}

### 4. Crear el mismo tópico otra vez -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "prueba-admin", "partitions": 2, "replicationFactor": 3 }

### 5. Nombre inválido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "nombre con espacios", "partitions": 1 }

### 6. Cambiar retención y aumentar particiones
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/prueba-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partitions": 4, "configs": { "retention.ms": "172800000" } }

### 7. Reducir particiones -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/prueba-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partitions": 1 }

### 8. Eliminar tópico -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/prueba-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Eliminar un tópico de la solución -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/uso-equipamiento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Tópico inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/admin/kafka/topics/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
